Begin with the two CSVs and the paper&#x27;s idea.

00:59:19.774 --> 00:59:23.730
Follow one packet through preparation, the
adapted encoder,

00:59:23.955 --> 00:59:25.494
training and inference.

00:59:25.895 --> 00:59:29.224
State what the joint results measure and mention
the stronger

00:59:29.224 --> 00:59:31.452
metadata control on U N S W.

00:59:31.853 --> 00:59:35.220
Explain what each repository is for and where to
find the setup

00:59:35.232 --> 00:59:35.721
and audit.

00:59:36.159 --> 00:59:39.375
Finish with the difference between the recorded
demonstration and

00:59:39.388 --> 00:59:41.340
an operational intrusion detector.

00:59:41.754 --> 00:59:44.858
Take the upcoming pause to practice that story
